+Feature: App entry point
+  As a user opening the app in a browser
+  I want an index.html at the project root that renders the TodoMVC interface
+  So that the app is visible and functional without a build step
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: The project root contains an index.html that loads the app
+    Given the project root directory
+    Then a file "index.html" exists at the project root
+    And "index.html" contains a section element with class "todoapp"
+    And "index.html" contains an input element with class "new-todo"
+    And "index.html" contains a script tag that loads "js/app.js"
